     "set": {
      "text": "f = B′C + A′B + AC′",
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Or start one step further round: A′C + BC′ + AB′. Also three pairs and 6 literals. Two different minimal SOPs: the minimal form is not unique.",
